## 3) ШАГ B — decode_ogg: radio-tolerant (НЕ переписывать весь кодек)

Файл: `micro_flac/.../flac_decoder.cpp` → `decode_ogg`.

### 3.1 БАЗА = upstream loop
```
bytes_consumed += state.bytes_consumed;
NEED_MORE → continue if remaining else return NEED_MORE;
```
**УДАЛИТЬ** bare:
```cpp
if ((mf_millis() - t0) > 12) return FLAC_DECODER_NEED_MORE_DATA; // FORBIDDEN as-is
```

### 3.2 PATCH-1: native_consumed mismatch ≠ always fatal  
**БЫЛО (убивает radio):**
```cpp
if (native_consumed != body_len)
  return set_fatal_error(OGG_DEMUX);
```

**СТАЛО (OMNIA-PATCH Log60):**
```cpp
if (native_consumed != body_len) {
  if (result == FLAC_DECODER_SUCCESS || result == FLAC_DECODER_HEADER_READY) {
    // leftover padding after full frame/header — ignore tail, keep result
  } else if (result == FLAC_DECODER_NEED_MORE_DATA) {
    // partial frame should consume whole packet body in Ogg-FLAC;
    // mismatch → drop frame state, packet already advanced by demuxer
    this->reset_frame_state();
    continue;
  } else if (result < 0) {
    // return REAL frame error (SYNC/CRC/...), DO NOT rewrite to OGG_DEMUX
    this->reset_frame_state();
    // DO NOT set_fatal_error in AUDIO phase
    return result;
  } else {
    this->reset_frame_state();
    continue;
  }
}
```

### 3.3 PATCH-2: AUDIO-phase demux errors НЕ latch forever
- `state.result < 0` → `ogg_demuxer_->reset()`; seek next `OggS` in remaining; return `NEED_MORE` (soft), **НЕ** `set_fatal_error`.
- unknown non-OK → то же.
- `set_fatal_error` **только** pre-HEADER (detect / BOS / bad BOS prefix / header parse).

### 3.4 PATCH-3: anti zero-consume + optional budget
```cpp
if (state.result == OGG_NEED_MORE_DATA) {
  if (ogg_eos_seen_) return EOS;
  if (state.bytes_consumed == 0 && remaining > 0) {
    // one-shot resync to next OggS (skip >= 1)
    // else force bytes_consumed = min(1, remaining) anti-stuck
  }
  if (bytes_consumed < input_len) continue;
  return NEED_MORE;
}
```
OPTIONAL time budget: **только в конце итерации**, **только если** `bytes_consumed > 0` **или** `remaining == 0`; budget 30–40 ms.  
**Никогда** budget → NEED_MORE с 0 consume при remaining>0 без anti-stuck byte.

### 3.5 PATCH-4 (Log60 critical): SYNC_NOT_FOUND / frame errors in AUDIO inside decode_ogg
```cpp
if (result == FLAC_DECODER_ERROR_SYNC_NOT_FOUND ||
    result == FLAC_DECODER_ERROR_BAD_HEADER ||
    result == FLAC_DECODER_ERROR_CRC_MISMATCH /* etc soft */) {
  this->reset_frame_state();
  // packet already consumed by demuxer → continue to NEXT packet
  // DO NOT fatal, DO NOT return -2 to caller on every short page
  if (bytes_consumed < input_len) continue;
  return FLAC_DECODER_NEED_MORE_DATA; // soft: let caller feed more
}
```
Цель: один битый/не-audio packet не должен генерировать 30× `-2` наружу за 1 с.

